        "name": "USN-3171-1",
        "description": "Josef Gajdusek discovered that the LibVNCServer client library incorrectly handled certain FrameBufferUpdate messages.  If a user were tricked into connecting to a malicious server, an attacker could use this issue to cause a denial of service, or possibly execute arbitrary code. (CVE-2016-9941, CVE-2016-9942)",
